For stateful behavior, distinguish operation completion from deferred cleanup: another caller may enter between them. Follow entry, completion and recovery through the existing owner; test that interval when the contract depends on it. Preserve existing or specified values, errors, cleanup and cancellation. For suppressed operations, assert suppression and ownership without inventing return contracts. Extend existing tests, not a parallel harness.

